#: 47b09e5fb30b40ab8d82d4a87b775cf0
msgid ""
"Understand what GWexpy validates publicly for notebooks, direct I/O formats,"
" algorithm audit notes, and repository coverage signals, and where each "
"evidence source lives."
msgstr ""
"GWexpy が公開で検証している範囲（ノートブック、direct I/O 形式、アルゴリズム監査ノート、リポジトリの coverage "
"シグナル）と、各根拠の所在を整理します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:7
#: 445a671f01c04f31b75c10a19ff5587a
msgid "Verification and Quality Signals"
msgstr "検証と品質の見方"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:9
#: 82a649d29ad84dd482d89749fee6e0ca
msgid ""
"This page explains what kinds of public verification signals `gwexpy` "
"exposes today, where those signals come from, and how to interpret their "
"limits."
msgstr ""
"このページでは、`gwexpy` が現在どの種類の検証シグナルを公開しているか、その根拠がどこにあるか、そしてその限界をどう読むべきかを整理します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:11
#: 4ea63817de9a4bbeb07b6b49bf75e8da
msgid ""
"It is not a single \"all features are verified\" claim. Instead, it points "
"you to the current evidence sources for notebooks, direct I/O formats, "
"algorithm audits, and repository-level coverage reporting."
msgstr ""
"ここで示すのは「すべての機能が一様に検証済み」という主張ではありません。Notebook、direct I/O、アルゴリズム監査、リポジトリ全体の "
"coverage について、それぞれ別の根拠に辿れるようにするための案内ページです。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:14
#: 7c71ea70c26f43cbb3b55c96260ef48a
msgid "**Read this page as a transparency map, not as a blanket guarantee**"
msgstr "**このページは「透明性の地図」であって、一括保証ではありません**"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:16
#: 45098a6e905841f6ae5e7493157e63cf
msgid ""
"Different parts of the project are verified in different ways. Nightly CI "
"runs cross-platform import smoke tests and targeted gates (network/backend "
"I/O, docs notebooks, Zarr I/O), some notebooks are fully executed, some "
"heavy notebooks are only structure-checked, and some optional-dependency "
"tests can be skipped when the backend is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"検証の方法は対象ごとに異なります。Nightly CI "
"ではクロスプラットフォームのインポートスモークテストと対象を絞ったゲート（ネットワーク/バックエンド I/O、docs ノートブック、Zarr "
"I/O）が実行されます。Notebook の中には CI で全実行されるものもあれば、重い notebook "
"のように構造確認中心のものもあり、optional dependency を持つテストは環境によって skip される場合もあります。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:19
