msgstr "Notebook の検証方針"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:31
#: 1832ead11655425bbc837030436bca37
msgid ""
"The public notebook policy is defined in the repository's [Notebook "
"Policy](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/docs/NOTEBOOK_POLICY.md)."
msgstr ""
"公開 notebook の扱いは、リポジトリ内の [Notebook Policy](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/docs/NOTEBOOK_POLICY.md) に基づきます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:33
#: c342029b706c4b35b5c43fc02ec920a0
msgid "The current public model is:"
msgstr "現時点の公開方針は次のとおりです。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:35
#: d62e5d9821b04555ab687e948f3e58a2
msgid ""
"The public [extended nightly workflow](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/.github/workflows/extended-nightly.yml) runs cross-"
"platform import smoke tests and the `io-network-backend`, `docs-notebook`, "
"and `io-zarr` gates; it is intentionally scoped to these checks and does not"
" run docstring doctests."
msgstr ""
"公開されている [extended nightly workflow](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/.github/workflows/extended-nightly.yml) "
"は、クロスプラットフォームのインポートスモークテストと `io-network-backend`・`docs-notebook`・`io-zarr` "
"ゲートを実行します。意図的にこれらのチェックへ範囲を絞っており、docstring の doctest は実行しません。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:36
#: 65b3704099ea4979b82b15168e7f208b
msgid ""
"**Light** notebooks are classified for full execution and validation in CI "
"through `papermill`."
msgstr ""
"**Light** notebook は、Notebook Policy 上では CI で `papermill` により全実行される想定です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:37
#: 71c415d6969d4756ae1b28ed30d153b2
msgid ""
"**Heavy** notebooks are kept in CI, but the policy describes them as `nbval "
"--nbval-lax` checks rather than guaranteed full execution."
msgstr ""
"**Heavy** notebook は CI 対象ではありますが、全セル実行を常に保証するものではなく、構造確認や収集確認に寄せて扱われます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:38
#: 039ab698a4084a048d85857e54b7c24a
msgid ""
"**Display-only** notebooks prioritize curated outputs and are outside normal"
" execution validation, or limited to load-style checks."
msgstr ""
"**Display-only** notebook は整えた出力の保持を重視しており、「CI で毎回全実行される "
"notebook」と同義ではありません。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:39
#: 43cc5603af644240859e66a6e5de5e85
msgid ""
"The public [docs PR workflow](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/.github/workflows/docs-pr.yml) also executes "
"changed notebooks with `papermill` before building Sphinx HTML."
msgstr ""
"公開されている [docs PR workflow](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/.github/workflows/docs-pr.yml) では、docs Pull Request"
" で変更された notebook に対して `papermill` が実行されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:40
#: 61eaada2c8a540c4aa9e43c91605060d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Public tutorial notebooks under `docs/web/{en,ja}/user_guide/tutorials/` are"
" treated as the authoritative published copies."
msgstr "公開 notebook のメインのは `docs/web/{en,ja}/user_guide/tutorials/` に置かれます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:42
#: f94d449c3e3446969830fb1130b85e75
msgid ""
"This is why a notebook or docstring example being present in the docs is a "
"useful signal, but not enough on its own to infer that every published "
"sample is executed in every PR, nightly, and release path."
msgstr ""
"したがって、「公開 docs に notebook や例がある」こと自体は有益なシグナルですが、それだけで「あらゆる PR / Nightly / "
"release 経路で毎回一律に実行・保証される」とまでは読まない方が安全です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:44
#: 3a8484eff6894351a716329f99e9b3d2
msgid "Current CI Coverage and Its Limits"
msgstr "現在の CI カバレッジとその限界"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:46
#: 372cc7583c6144d0945117f5528a68cf
msgid ""
"The current public evidence supports a narrower statement than \"all sample "
"code is universally guaranteed.\""
msgstr "現在の公開根拠から言えるのは、「すべてのサンプルコードが一律に保証される」よりも狭い範囲です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:48
#: 3bbe02096ff04004b2d3fa7e52c8310e
msgid ""
"The extended nightly workflow shows that `gwexpy` runs automated import "
"smoke tests on three platforms plus targeted I/O and docs-notebook gates "
"every night."
msgstr ""
"extended nightly workflow が示すように、`gwexpy` は 3 "
"つのプラットフォームでのインポートスモークテストに加え、I/O と docs ノートブックのゲートを毎晩自動実行しています。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:49
#: 86217e64155b4c3583a1730ec1cb58d0
msgid ""
"The [Notebook Policy](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/docs/NOTEBOOK_POLICY.md) shows that notebook "
"handling is class-dependent: `Light` notebooks are executed with "
"`papermill`, while `Heavy` notebooks are checked with `nbval --nbval-lax`."
msgstr ""
"[Notebook Policy](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/docs/NOTEBOOK_POLICY.md) が示すように、notebook "
"の扱いは分類依存で、`Light` は `papermill` で実行、`Heavy` は `nbval --nbval-lax` で確認されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:50
#: 9e4ba508537c491588038f7eb0a6689a
msgid ""
"The docs PR workflow shows that notebooks changed in docs pull requests are "
"executed with `papermill` before the docs build."
msgstr "docs PR workflow では、docs PR で変更された notebook に対して `papermill` が実行されます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:52
#: d01115ec40a84dfd9ad031b306d9cb99
msgid "Read those signals carefully:"
msgstr "このシグナルは次のように読んでください。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:54
#: c5e0182f0a3d47b0b10319d76a18afcd
msgid ""
"They show that public examples are not unmanaged; some are exercised "
"automatically in CI today."
msgstr "公開例が完全に放置されているわけではなく、現在も自動検証の経路があります。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:55
#: e37ffff8fffa40ea8408d205592443a2
msgid ""
"They do **not** mean every published code block is executed in every "
"workflow."
msgstr "ただし、すべての公開コード片が、すべての workflow で毎回実行されることを意味しません。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:56
#: 0fb5bced35984a01ba04221889dfed4e
msgid ""
"They do **not** mean Doctest or notebook coverage is a single release-"
"blocking gate for the whole documentation set."
msgstr ""
"Doctest や notebook 検証が、ドキュメント全体に対する単一の release-blocking gate だという意味でもありません。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:57
#: d6c59344f8274a3cb85d9b90d0df9b1e
msgid ""
"They do **not** remove the need to check notebook class, optional "
"dependencies, and workflow scope before treating an example as strongly "
"guaranteed."
msgstr ""
"強い保証として読む前に、notebook の分類、optional dependency、どの workflow "
"がその対象を見ているかを確認する必要があります。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/verification_and_quality.md:59
